n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 110px;\n    right: 49px;\n    bottom: 38px;\n    height: 37px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    font-weight: 300;\n  }\n\n  .footer-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    color: #f45b16;\n    font-weight: 500;\n  }\n\n  .footer-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 49px;\n    bottom: 0;\n    color: #666;\n  }\n\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: -2px;\n    color: #333;\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 29px;\n    line-height: 34px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <main class=\"content\">\n    <section aria-labelledby=\"fund-business-title\">\n      <h1 id=\"fund-business-title\" class=\"section-title\">资金同业业务</h1>\n      <p class=\"intro\">平安银行资金同业业务通过“投资交易+客户业务”双轮驱动，持续提升投资、交易和销售三大能力，助力金融市场高质量发展。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"business-blocks\">\n        <div class=\"business-row\">\n          <div class=\"vertical-label\">投资交易</div>\n\n          <div class=\"icon-wrap\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg class=\"business-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 142 132\">\n              <path d=\"M35 21h72a8 8 0 0 1 8 8v14\"/>\n              <path d=\"M35 21a8 8 0 0 0-8 8v10h16V29a8 8 0 0 0-8-8z\"/>\n              <path d=\"M43 34h39\"/>\n              <path d=\"M43 48v45\"/>\n              <path d=\"M43 103v12a8 8 0 0 0 8 8\"/>\n              <path d=\"M51 123h73a8 8 0 0 0 8-8v-10H57v10a8 8 0 0 1-6 8z\"/>\n              <path d=\"M25 57h31v-10l15 15-15 15V67H25z\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"114\" cy=\"55\" r=\"20\"/>\n              <path d=\"M105 47l9 10 9-10\"/>\n              <path d=\"M114 57v16\"/>\n              <path d=\"M106 59h16\"/>\n              <path d=\"M106 66h16\"/>\n              <path d=\"M53 90h24\"/>\n              <path d=\"M53 101h31\"/>\n              <path d=\"M130 87h-31V77L84 92l15 15V97h31z\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"business-copy first\">\n            <p>平安银行加强宏观分析研判，在保障资产端的流动性与安全性前提下，优化交易策略，<br>\n            合理配置持仓组合，保持稳健投资。2024年，平安银行债券交易量的市场份额为4.4%，<br>\n            同比上升1.2个百分点。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"business-row\">\n          <div class=\"vertical-label\">客户业务</div>\n\n          <div class=\"icon-wrap\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg class=\"business-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 142 132\">\n              <path d=\"M35 27h35\"/>\n              <path d=\"M35 27v105h80V103\"/>\n              <path d=\"M48 47h12\"/>\n              <path d=\"M48 103h48\"/>\n              <path d=\"M48 114h48\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"44\" r=\"25\"/>\n              <path d=\"M68 73c8-7 17-10 27-10 22 0 39 15 39 37\"/>\n              <path d=\"M116 32a16 16 0 1 1 7 30\"/>\n              <path d=\"M124 68c16 4 24 15 24 29\"/>\n              <circle cx=\"35\" cy=\"77\" r=\"19\"/>\n              <path d=\"M27 77l6 6 11-13\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"business-copy second\">\n            <p>平安银行依托客户综合服务优势，在做市、避险、机构销售、托管等多领域积极发力。<br>\n            2024年，平安银行境内外机构销售的现券交易量4.54万亿元，同比增长46.0%；在平安银<br>\n            行办理外汇即期及衍生品避险业务的客户达14,987户，同比增长16.5%；截至2024年12<br>\n            月31日，通过“行e通”平台销售的资管产品保有规模2,667.05亿元，较年初增长33.2%；<br>\n            托管净值规模达9.10万亿元，较年初增长4.6%。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"metrics\" aria-labelledby=\"metrics-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"metrics-title\" class=\"section-title metrics-title\">银行业务关键指标</h2>\n\n      <table class=\"metrics-table performance-table\" aria-label=\"经营成果\">\n        <colgroup>\n          <col class=\"label-col\">\n          <col class=\"current-col\">\n          <col class=\"previous-col\">\n          <col class=\"change-col\">\n        </colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>（人民币百万元）</th>\n            <th class=\"emphasis\">2024年</th>\n            <th>2023年</th>\n            <th>变动(%)</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"group-row\">\n            <td colspan=\"4\">经营成果</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>营业收入</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">146,695</td>\n            <td>164,699</td>\n            <td>（10.9）</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>净利润</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">44,508</td>\n            <td>46,455</td>\n            <td>（4.2）</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>成本收入比(%)</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">27.66</td>\n            <td>27.90</td>\n            <td>下降0.24个百分点</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>平均总资产收益率(%)</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">0.78</td>\n            <td>0.85</td>\n            <td>下降0.07个百分点</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>加权平均净资产收益率(%)</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">10.08</td>\n            <td>11.38</td>\n            <td>下降1.30个百分点</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"section-end\">\n            <td>净息差(%)</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">1.87</td>\n            <td>2.38</td>\n            <td>下降0.51个百分点</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <table class=\"metrics-table balance-table\" aria-label=\"存贷款业务、资产质量和资本充足率\">\n        <colgroup>\n          <col class=\"label-col\">\n          <col class=\"current-col\">\n          <col class=\"previous-col\">\n          <col class=\"change-col\">\n        </colgroup>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>（人民币百万元）</th>\n            <th class=\"emphasis\">2024年12月31日</th>\n            <th>2023年12月31日</th>\n            <th>变动</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"group-row\">\n            <td colspan=\"4\">存贷款业务<sup>(1)</sup></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>吸收存款</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">3,533,678</td>\n            <td>3,407,295</td>\n            <td>3.7%</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"indented\">其中：个人存款</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">1,287,180</td>\n            <td>1,207,618</td>\n            <td>6.6%</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"deep-indented\">企业存款</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">2,246,498</td>\n            <td>2,199,677</td>\n            <td>2.1%</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>发放贷款和垫款总额</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">3,374,103</td>\n            <td>3,407,509</td>\n            <td>（1.0%）</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"indented\">其中：个人贷款</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">1,767,168</td>\n            <td>1,977,719</td>\n            <td>（10.6%）</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"deep-indented\">企业贷款</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">1,606,935</td>\n            <td>1,429,790</td>\n            <td>12.4%</td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"group-row asset-heading\">\n            <td colspan=\"4\">资产质量</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>不良贷款率(%)</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">1.06</td>\n            <td>1.06</td>\n            <td>–</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>拨备覆盖率(%)</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">250.71</td>\n            <td>277.63</td>\n            <td>下降26.92个百分点</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>逾期60天以上贷款偏离度<sup>(2)</sup></td>\n            <td class=\"current\">0.80</td>\n            <td>0.74</td>\n            <td>上升0.06</td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <tr class=\"group-row capital-heading\">\n            <td colspan=\"4\">资本充足率</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"capital-final\">\n            <td>核心一级资本充足率<sup>(3)</sup>(%)</td>\n            <td class=\"current\">9.12</td>\n            <td>9.22</td>\n            <td>下降0.10个百分点</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"notes\">\n        <div class=\"note-line\">\n          <span class=\"note-label\">注：</span>\n          <span>(1)&nbsp; 吸收存款、发放贷款和垫款总额及其明细项目均为不含息金额。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"note-line indented-note\">\n          <span class=\"note-label\"></span>\n          <span>(2)&nbsp; 逾期60天以上贷款偏离度=逾期60天以上贷款余额／不良贷款余额。</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"note-line indented-note\">\n          <span class=\"note-label\"></span>\n          <span>(3)&nbsp; 核心一级资本充足率的最低监管要求为7.75%。</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside class=\"right-tab\" aria-label=\"经营情况讨论与分析\">\n    <div class=\"tab-characters\">\n      <span>经</span>\n      <span>营</span>\n      <span>情</span>\n      <span>况</span>\n      <span>讨</span>\n      <span>论</span>\n      <span>与</span>\n      <span>分</span>\n      <span>析</span>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"footer-left\">二零二四年年报</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-right\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司</div>\n    <div class=\"page-number\">51</div>\n  </footer>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
